        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/ccd318/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-05T00:08:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes, I know about the tournemants that GTG is having, but the orginal poster mentioned in his first post about&nbsp; the store Limited Figures having one, and that is what i would be interested in.&nbsp; kC is about 3 hours away and not a bad drive for a day trip for a tournemant. Unfortunaly i was working when GTG had theirs at their warehouse is St Louis, otherwise I might have driven the 6 hours to go to it. That one would not have been a day trip though.</p>",
