        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dshields/{size}/1968_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-06T08:05:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Still working out the Date, Most of the Players I have that have come to the Store can only do a Thursday like 5-9 Or Very Late night Sat(8-9pm start), I only Have 3 People that could do a all day \"Sat\" event. So still working out the best time. I have been working on Prizes. We are thinking of a $5 entry fee per person and the winning team will win the 3 figures (Dawn,Ra,Beacon) Plus Depending on How many teams we have enter. Will win a Min. $60 ($20 for each member of the winning team) Store Credit. the 2nd place team will get $15 ($5 for each member of the 2nd place team) Store Credit.</p><p>So if we have the max of 16 teams thats $180 ($60 per member 1st place) or $105 ($35 per member 2nd place) of store credit.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
